{"title":"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3df79a4384bc29acd37e14b0430773d09964ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bigtriangleup ABC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is a point on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/12517bbc31cb9026c71299b7a0d232d07e60f284.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AC}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f8660714edf215ea7c64e9d4cc0a5347eafd75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD=DC$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/3/23386faeefe37629243fa264877b288499db5048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BCD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> measures <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31adfcb608f857dff15cc5fa7ea0c327e8dc65ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />. What is the degree measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/718105456aa41c974333e9ffe73a31053003c68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/7/94770df9a0e1d5a71f602bfb3b45022dcca9dec4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(300); defaultpen(linewidth(0.8)); pair A=(-1,0),C=(1,0),B=dir(40),D=origin; draw(A--B--C--A); draw(D--B); dot(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); dot(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, NE); dot(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, SE); dot(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, S); label(&quot;$70^\\circ$&quot;,C,2*dir(180-35));[/asy]\" width=\"502\" height=\"192\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93ca916e5b3c993fb423ff8c0717970fddb2a483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }100\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }120\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }135\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }140\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"443\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jLnqUOe0HPE\">https://youtu.be/jLnqUOe0HPE</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HP-lBKohxhE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HP-lBKohxhE</a>   ~David\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j5KrHM81HZ8\">https://youtu.be/j5KrHM81HZ8</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/abSgjn4Qs34?t=3140\">https://youtu.be/abSgjn4Qs34?t=3140</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using angle chasing is a good way to solve this problem. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f35fe2c75c113f7cdd2f6c59a1ca76e728c540b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = DC$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3ee07ed43b0207ca0436d7576f6daad8815e6d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBC = \\angle DCB = 70$\" width=\"181\" height=\"12\" />, because it is an isosceles triangle. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa145e5b191aa6bcdadcf67cfc088316459cbd60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CDB = 180-(70+70) = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"248\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/718105456aa41c974333e9ffe73a31053003c68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/5/fd5529f83cca44961d418dc5a92baf90a667913c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BDC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> are supplementary, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/0/e90ed2c634f80d7b7300f0a3d529df7469eec95b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADB = 180 - 40 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~140}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"247\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8\">2014 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2014\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2014 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"